          "notice": "ERC20 approve(). Comes with the standard caveat that an approval\r meant to limit spending may actually allow more to be spent due to\r unfortunate ordering of transactions. For safety, this method\r should only be called if the current allowance is 0. Alternatively,\r non-ERC20 increaseApproval() and decreaseApproval() can be used.\r"
